    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "73. Ten Successors"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a9337b70bcf3d69f67232b336a994149"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "The pupil's guardian, hearing of the accident went directly to Ekido."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2734 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_254,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2735,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_96 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "73. Ten Successors"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d30e654300104eb6cd4b5723e0880442"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Knowing that he was not to blame he praised the master for his severe teaching."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2736 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_1148,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_871 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "73. Ten Successors"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "abf9e5de39d20dd0ec8f16c842c5de30"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Ekido's attitude was just the same as if the pupil were still alive."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2737 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_254,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2738 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "73. Ten Successors"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "63506df761d704f458beae0923d3b0ec"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "After this took place, he was able to produce under his guidance more than ten enlightened successors, a very unusual number."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2739 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_46,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_624 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "74. True Reformation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3ffa99753bd7fd856d1eaa1cec5089dc"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Ryokan devoted his life to the study of Zen."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_274 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_254,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_275,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_276,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_277 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "2. Finding a Diamond on a Muddy Road"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9ea01443e6bc84949e6701b40a7829c2"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Once when he was on his way to Edo, the cultural and political center of the shogunate, he approached a little village mad Takenaka."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2740 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2741,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2742,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2743,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_777 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "74. True Reformation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ae07358db61fb0e0caa45d6180e46ce5"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "One day he heard that his nephew, despite the admonitions of relatives, was spending his money on a courtesan."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2744 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2742,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2745,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2746,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_624,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_777 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "74. True Reformation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ad57a42962f10c0153f018622bded911"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Inasmuch as the nephew had taken Ryokan's place in managing the family estate and the property was in danger of being dissipated, the relatives asked Ryokan to do something about it."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2747 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2742,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_624 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "74. True Reformation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2403d803aeb42ca9308f4fdc1161600c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Ryokan had to travel a long way to visit his nephew, whom he had not seen for many years."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2748 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2741,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2742 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "74. True Reformation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "52dc9b0ee9a4f754ea76f82a9b5cebab"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "The nephew seemed pleased to meet his uncle again and invited him to remain overnight."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2749 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_180,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_624 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "74. True Reformation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7ed08805a610398a10d873e6842f85c1"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "All night Ryokan sat in meditation."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2750 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_1222,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_254,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2751,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_747 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "74. True Reformation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d44231c164e98373854451e3d31f7f88"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "As he was departing in the morning he said to the young man: 'I must be getting old, my hand shakes so."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2753 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_217,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2754,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2755,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_324 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "74. True Reformation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "07d175be25ae45ad9964385f19c3b84f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Will you help me tie the string of my straw sandal?'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2756 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2742,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_293 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "74. True Reformation"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "475408f112d4371bedb6e93ffcb464a4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "The nephew helped him willingly."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_2757 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_624 ;
