    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "When he was getting very old, he told them a story he had heard in China."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_649 a neo:Document ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. The Last Poem of Hoshin"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "6969577b18bcfe02f51bc8aa92366f49"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "This is the story:"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_650 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_63,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_651,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_652 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. The Last Poem of Hoshin"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "50458f0e7af0c79bac790ac17a509c2d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "One year on the twenty-fifth of December, Tokufu, who was very old, said to his disciples: 'I am not going to-be alive next year so you fellows should treat me well this year.'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_653 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_574,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_575,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_654,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_655 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. The Last Poem of Hoshin"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "dc8a56fc25336387bd68cb0f425e5211"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "The pupils thought he was joking, but since he was a great-hearted teacher each of them in turn treated him to a feast on succeeding days of the departing year."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_656 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_651,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_657 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. The Last Poem of Hoshin"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2e08ebd066da48c8eb5bc66ecd280fd8"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "On the eve of the New Year, Tokufu concluded: 'You have been good to me."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_658 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_217,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_320,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_659,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_660 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. The Last Poem of Hoshin"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "8b3f1616a095d64a733306b285c0a237"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "I shall leave you tomorrow afternoon when the snow has stopped.'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_661 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_254,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_343,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_660,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_662 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. The Last Poem of Hoshin"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7d54061d2c43465ed24f52b782e3a6cf"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "The disciples laughed, thinking he was aging and talking nonsense since the night was clear and without snow."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_663 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_206,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_660,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_664,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_665 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. The Last Poem of Hoshin"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "6adee2563ce689926e5c3e5d15604ec5"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "But at midnight snow began to fall, and the next day they did not find their teacher about."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_666 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_206,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_667 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. The Last Poem of Hoshin"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "de6b6edf799d120a1c42706582ce30e5"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "They went to the meditation hall."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_668 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_254,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_669 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. The Last Poem of Hoshin"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d1b3acfef8439456c713bac06cc680f7"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "There he had passed on."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_670 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_364,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_63,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_643,
        ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_671 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. The Last Poem of Hoshin"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "60f4d0e21cbbd964af2a28365b82d203"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Hoshin, who related this story, told his disciples: 'It is not necessary for a Zen master to predict his passing, but if he really wishes to do so, he can.'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_672 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_217 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "101 ZEN STORIES"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "10. The Last Poem of Hoshin"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c5f50f03b77e59cda9603abdd5fdd41b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "1957_-_Paul_Reps_-_Zen_flesh_zen_bones-A_Collection_of_Zen_and_Pre_Zen_Writings_-_Scan_by_OceanofPDF_dot_com_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "zen-flesh-zen-bones"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "'Can you?'"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_673 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_e6fd553a_757d_4b22_bddf_2b1da6c9e882_674 ;
    neo:h1 "ZEN FLESH, ZEN BONES"^^xsd:string ;
